	(text "EXT exists to expose DONE and INITN\nprimarily for the possible future \nexpansion using I2C to daughter boards, and \nsecondarily for debugging.  \n\nFor the I2C use case, the 4.7 kOhm pullups\n are sufficient for a 100 pF bus at 400 kHz"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
